Satoshi kept Bitcoin simple on purpose.

Even the transactions he designed:
Escrow. Bonds. Arbitration. Multisig.

Vitalik went further: any program, on proof-of-work.

Only one chain kept that design, Ethereum Classic.

Bitcoin's philosophy. Ethereum's technology. 🍀